1
00:00:26,359 --> 00:00:27,193
‎Bun-hong.

2
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:28,737
‎Yes, madam.

3
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,113
‎Where is Yun?

4
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,198
‎Well…

5
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:33,700
‎The thing is…

6
00:00:51,509 --> 00:00:53,928
‎Thank you all for your trouble today.

7
00:01:50,527 --> 00:01:52,320
‎Won, you have grown into a fine young man.

8
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:54,781
‎Thank you, Uncle.

9
00:01:56,116 --> 00:01:57,408
‎I trust you have been well.

10
00:01:57,492 --> 00:02:00,286
‎Indeed. Look at you,
‎you have come along admirably!

11
00:02:02,539 --> 00:02:03,373
‎Won.

12
00:02:03,456 --> 00:02:08,002
‎I have set aside a new weasel-hair brush
‎made from black bamboo for the elder.

13
00:02:08,086 --> 00:02:10,630
‎Would you go
‎to the study annex and fetch it?

14
00:02:11,589 --> 00:02:12,423
‎That will do.

15
00:02:12,507 --> 00:02:14,634
‎Yes, certainly.

16
00:03:00,263 --> 00:03:02,307
‎You are not meant to come in here.

17
00:03:04,392 --> 00:03:05,643
‎I might say the same of you.

18
00:03:05,727 --> 00:03:09,272
‎How dare a young woman
‎behave as such in my uncle's study annex?

19
00:03:12,525 --> 00:03:14,444
‎Won, it is you.

20
00:03:15,403 --> 00:03:16,529
‎Cousin Yun?

21
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:19,657
‎You have grown into quite the man.

22
00:03:19,741 --> 00:03:21,242
‎I almost did not recognize you.

23
00:03:29,417 --> 00:03:31,586
‎Good heavens! The brush!

24
00:03:31,669 --> 00:03:33,713
‎Uncle sent me to fetch it!

25
00:03:33,796 --> 00:03:35,548
‎How could you have used it?

26
00:03:35,632 --> 00:03:37,842
‎It is a brush,
‎meant to be used by someone in time.

27
00:03:38,635 --> 00:03:39,802
‎What matter is it?

28
00:03:42,805 --> 00:03:46,434
‎He laughed so heartily
‎it quite took me aback.

29
00:03:51,147 --> 00:03:52,357
‎He has brought it.

30
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,900
‎Is that the brush?

31
00:03:59,489 --> 00:04:01,616
‎Won, did you use the brush?

32
00:04:01,699 --> 00:04:03,952
‎Surely he would not be so ill-mannered.

33
00:04:04,035 --> 00:04:06,496
‎Won, speak for yourself.

34
00:04:07,413 --> 00:04:08,665
‎But that is not…

35
00:04:08,748 --> 00:04:09,916
‎Well, let us see

36
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:15,046
‎what Won has written here.

37
00:04:17,465 --> 00:04:21,094
‎My word, did you truly write this?

38
00:04:21,886 --> 00:04:23,429
‎I would like to see it as well.

39
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:26,140
‎Goodness, brother. Do take a look.

40
00:04:26,224 --> 00:04:28,059
‎Here it is.

41
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:38,444
‎Well, well, the boy shows promise.

42
00:04:38,528 --> 00:04:42,573
‎Expound the virtues that make tobacco
‎The southern sacred herb

43
00:04:42,657 --> 00:04:44,993
‎A loyal subject

44
00:04:45,076 --> 00:04:47,161
‎As the topic is set

45
00:04:47,245 --> 00:04:49,747
‎The examination hall
‎Becomes quite a spectacle

46
00:04:50,832 --> 00:04:52,542
‎Now, whose son might this be?

47
00:04:52,625 --> 00:04:55,461
‎He has studied remarkably well

48
00:04:55,545 --> 00:04:59,048
‎I owe him for this handsome pay

49
00:04:59,132 --> 00:05:02,969
‎So what choice have I but to sing as bid?

50
00:05:03,594 --> 00:05:06,764
‎May you achieve top honors
‎In the civil service exam

51
00:05:06,848 --> 00:05:08,516
‎-Sir.
‎-‎Well, well

52
00:05:08,599 --> 00:05:13,062
‎-‎One slips a few coins to the examiner
‎-A small token.

53
00:05:13,146 --> 00:05:16,566
‎Another takes measure of the room

54
00:05:16,649 --> 00:05:20,111
‎Still the neck stiffens, the head throbs

55
00:05:20,903 --> 00:05:26,159
‎Buy a discarded script if you will
‎What use is it?

56
00:05:26,242 --> 00:05:28,703
‎-‎This scholar copies on the sly
‎-Get him out of here!

57
00:05:28,786 --> 00:05:30,872
‎That one does not even trouble to hide it

58
00:05:30,955 --> 00:05:32,498
‎-No, sir!
‎-You even copied his name.

59
00:05:32,582 --> 00:05:37,587
‎And that poor fellow
‎With neither wit nor luck

60
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:41,966
‎Finds himself cast out of the hall

61
00:05:42,050 --> 00:05:44,093
‎When the hall is in an uproar

62
00:05:44,177 --> 00:05:46,679
‎At so strange a topic

63
00:05:47,221 --> 00:05:52,518
‎There he is, like a crane just alighted

64
00:05:55,521 --> 00:05:57,732
‎With calm eyes

65
00:05:58,232 --> 00:06:02,028
‎And a faint smile upon his lips

66
00:06:03,654 --> 00:06:06,365
‎His strokes

67
00:06:06,449 --> 00:06:11,913
‎Supple yet forceful

68
00:06:11,996 --> 00:06:16,167
‎Soar like a black dragon

69
00:06:16,250 --> 00:06:18,920
‎To the blue clouds

70
00:06:20,213 --> 00:06:21,631
‎Well, well

71
00:06:21,714 --> 00:06:25,635
‎Here he is

72
00:06:25,718 --> 00:06:29,931
‎Top honors in the civil service exam
‎The garlanded victor

73
00:06:31,015 --> 00:06:34,769
‎Here he is

74
00:06:35,353 --> 00:06:37,480
‎I was beside myself
‎with worry for that boy,

75
00:06:37,563 --> 00:06:41,109
‎studying under his taciturn father.

76
00:06:41,192 --> 00:06:42,318
‎Won.

77
00:06:42,401 --> 00:06:44,987
‎Surely you have
‎at least one literary friend?

78
00:06:45,071 --> 00:06:46,405
‎A friend with whom

79
00:06:46,489 --> 00:06:48,991
‎you exchange letters
‎and share a friendship through words.

80
00:06:51,786 --> 00:06:53,412
‎We will bring the table in.

81
00:06:55,915 --> 00:06:57,542
‎I am sure he has many.

82
00:06:57,625 --> 00:06:59,919
‎A lad so keen.
‎If he has no literary friends,

83
00:07:00,002 --> 00:07:02,171
‎that would be his father's fault,
‎would it not?

84
00:07:03,798 --> 00:07:05,633
‎My apologies. I…

85
00:07:08,010 --> 00:07:11,347
‎His brilliance shone
‎in the initial examination as well.

86
00:07:13,641 --> 00:07:17,103
‎Who could have foreseen
‎a question on the virtues of tobacco?

87
00:07:17,186 --> 00:07:18,479
‎Indeed.

88
00:07:19,689 --> 00:07:23,151
‎Won, let us hear your answer.

89
00:07:26,696 --> 00:07:29,907
‎With tobacco's bitter scent
‎filling the mouth,

90
00:07:32,201 --> 00:07:34,620
‎one cannot utter what one would.

91
00:07:35,121 --> 00:07:36,581
‎Resentment rises,

92
00:07:36,664 --> 00:07:39,375
‎yet before it gathers,
‎one exhales it with the smoke,

93
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:40,877
‎letting it speak in one's stead.

94
00:07:41,461 --> 00:07:43,296
‎None hear it,

95
00:07:43,379 --> 00:07:45,381
‎thus one walks the path
‎of a loyal subject.

96
00:07:46,966 --> 00:07:50,011
‎Absolutely flawless, is it not?

97
00:07:50,595 --> 00:07:52,680
‎In the palace examination,

98
00:07:52,763 --> 00:07:55,349
‎we may well expect him to take top honors.

99
00:07:55,433 --> 00:07:59,770
‎I owe it to my most worthy
‎and learned literary friend.

100
00:07:59,854 --> 00:08:00,813
‎You imprudent boy!

101
00:08:00,897 --> 00:08:03,733
‎How can you credit your own brilliance
‎to your literary friend?

102
00:08:03,816 --> 00:08:08,321
‎Were they so remarkable,
‎their names would long since be known.

103
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:13,910
‎Precisely.

104
00:08:16,621 --> 00:08:19,874
‎Have I ever been given the chance
‎for my name to be known?

105
00:08:26,339 --> 00:08:30,843
‎Seeing this, it is plain
‎Won takes after his father.

106
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,651
‎The entire family's hopes
‎seem to rest on you.

107
00:08:46,734 --> 00:08:47,860
‎It is all thanks to you.

108
00:08:48,486 --> 00:08:49,487
‎It is by your guidance

109
00:08:50,154 --> 00:08:53,449
‎that I have learned
‎and come to know so much.

110
00:09:12,176 --> 00:09:14,845
‎Miss Yun! Where are you?

111
00:09:15,346 --> 00:09:17,056
‎Your mother is looking for you!

112
00:09:17,682 --> 00:09:20,518
‎No, you already had plenty of talent.

113
00:09:21,185 --> 00:09:22,979
‎I simply helped you see it.

114
00:09:26,107 --> 00:09:28,901
‎Did I not tell you to stay
‎by Yun's side at all times?

115
00:09:29,694 --> 00:09:31,279
‎My apologies, madam.

116
00:09:31,362 --> 00:09:33,489
‎She disappeared all of a sudden.

117
00:10:27,043 --> 00:10:31,547
‎THE SCANDAL

118
00:10:32,173 --> 00:10:34,925
‎They're honored to have their daughter
‎taken to carry on your line,

119
00:10:35,009 --> 00:10:36,844
‎but hearing she'd learn
‎letters and painting

120
00:10:36,927 --> 00:10:38,471
‎under so virtuous a lady as yourself,

121
00:10:38,554 --> 00:10:40,806
‎the mother seemed ready
‎to come along herself.

122
00:10:42,058 --> 00:10:43,225
‎As I said,

123
00:10:43,809 --> 00:10:46,562
‎of the two daughters, the elder
‎resembles her father and is well-bred,

124
00:10:47,229 --> 00:10:50,608
‎but the younger takes after her mother
‎and only has a knack for trade.

125
00:10:52,026 --> 00:10:53,778
‎So it is the elder you should see.

126
00:11:01,911 --> 00:11:03,954
‎Silk for sale!

127
00:11:06,832 --> 00:11:08,793
‎Look at them, on all fours!

128
00:11:13,589 --> 00:11:15,424
‎Fine Qing silk!

129
00:11:16,050 --> 00:11:18,594
‎Ours is just the same! Madam, this way!

130
00:11:27,186 --> 00:11:30,022
‎We are most honored
‎you have come in person.

131
00:11:31,273 --> 00:11:33,401
‎I never thought
‎I'd have the honor of meeting you.

132
00:11:36,612 --> 00:11:38,864
‎Are all these the tobacco you sell?

133
00:11:38,948 --> 00:11:40,908
‎Oh, no, madam.

134
00:11:40,991 --> 00:11:43,452
‎The finer leaves
‎for esteemed guests are kept aside.

135
00:11:43,536 --> 00:11:46,455
‎These are rough and damp,
‎so I've gathered them separately,

136
00:11:46,539 --> 00:11:47,957
‎soon to be sent to Hwaseong.

137
00:11:49,166 --> 00:11:50,000
‎Hwaseong?

138
00:11:50,584 --> 00:11:53,796
‎They say His Majesty
‎is undertaking something there,

139
00:11:53,879 --> 00:11:55,881
‎and laborers from across the country
‎have gathered.

140
00:11:55,965 --> 00:11:57,591
‎And when such men gather,

141
00:11:57,675 --> 00:12:00,052
‎what else would they do
‎but puff away like chimneys?

142
00:12:00,136 --> 00:12:01,846
‎What was that fancy phrase again?

143
00:12:01,929 --> 00:12:03,305
‎Kill two birds with one stone.

144
00:12:03,889 --> 00:12:05,099
‎Skilled two birds with a tone.

145
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:10,146
‎Madam, let me escort you inside.

146
00:12:10,229 --> 00:12:12,231
‎Yes, madam.
‎This way to the inner quarters, please.

147
00:12:25,995 --> 00:12:28,497
‎As expected, you recognize it at once.

148
00:12:28,581 --> 00:12:29,832
‎It's quite worth the expense…

149
00:12:29,915 --> 00:12:32,543
‎I mean, I can hardly contain my joy.

150
00:12:33,043 --> 00:12:35,880
‎It is one of Shin Saimdang's
‎plant-and-insect paintings.

151
00:12:35,963 --> 00:12:37,965
‎Is it not truly exquisite?

152
00:12:42,928 --> 00:12:43,804
‎Madam.

153
00:12:43,888 --> 00:12:47,725
‎Since it seems to interest you,
‎there is something I would dare show you.

154
00:12:47,808 --> 00:12:50,352
‎Would you care to take a look?

155
00:13:07,203 --> 00:13:08,078
‎Might this be

156
00:13:09,413 --> 00:13:11,499
‎a work by Master Danwon?

157
00:13:11,582 --> 00:13:13,918
‎Yes, indeed!

158
00:13:14,001 --> 00:13:19,048
‎I have heard much
‎of your discerning eye for art,

159
00:13:19,131 --> 00:13:20,549
‎but to have you know it at once,

160
00:13:21,133 --> 00:13:22,760
‎I hardly know where to place myself.

161
00:13:27,306 --> 00:13:29,433
‎I look better in the flesh, do I not?

162
00:13:31,477 --> 00:13:32,353
‎No?

163
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,319
‎How is she?

164
00:13:52,164 --> 00:13:52,998
‎Well,

165
00:13:53,624 --> 00:13:56,377
‎she will likely
‎have difficulty conceiving.

166
00:14:00,214 --> 00:14:01,131
‎Thank you.

167
00:14:01,215 --> 00:14:02,049
‎Sure.

168
00:14:03,425 --> 00:14:05,135
‎Oh, whatever do you mean?

169
00:14:06,262 --> 00:14:09,807
‎The house shows uncommon taste throughout.

170
00:14:10,349 --> 00:14:11,308
‎Thank you.

171
00:14:11,392 --> 00:14:14,019
‎It is not merely a display of rare things.

172
00:14:14,103 --> 00:14:17,231
‎The harmony of its splendor
‎is a feast for the eyes.

173
00:14:18,524 --> 00:14:20,067
‎I found it most enjoyable.

174
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,193
‎Yes, well…

175
00:14:21,986 --> 00:14:24,154
‎Lowly as I am,
‎when I see something of value,

176
00:14:24,238 --> 00:14:26,407
‎I cannot rest till I have it in my hands.

177
00:14:27,908 --> 00:14:29,535
‎Would you like Saimdang's painting?

178
00:14:29,618 --> 00:14:31,829
‎If you wish, I will offer it as a gift.

179
00:14:31,912 --> 00:14:33,664
‎Or shall I summon Master Danwon himself?

180
00:14:36,041 --> 00:14:38,043
‎It would have been a fine match,

181
00:14:38,961 --> 00:14:41,755
‎yet it seems beyond our reach
‎to make such a tie.

182
00:14:43,007 --> 00:14:45,092
‎Mother, I shall bring in the refreshments.

183
00:14:52,099 --> 00:14:54,184
‎Well, these are ‎juak‎.

184
00:14:55,102 --> 00:14:56,729
‎Please enjoy, madam.

185
00:15:00,774 --> 00:15:01,859
‎What's the matter?

186
00:15:02,443 --> 00:15:03,861
‎They are really good.

187
00:15:07,281 --> 00:15:08,198
‎What?

188
00:15:09,241 --> 00:15:10,075
‎What…

189
00:15:11,118 --> 00:15:12,161
‎Damn you.

190
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:23,589
‎It really is good.

191
00:15:35,851 --> 00:15:36,852
‎This time…

192
00:15:37,770 --> 00:15:39,730
‎There. I will place it here.

193
00:15:40,689 --> 00:15:41,815
‎What do you think?

194
00:16:01,251 --> 00:16:02,169
‎Let me see.

195
00:16:09,259 --> 00:16:11,303
‎He was playing until a moment ago,

196
00:16:11,971 --> 00:16:14,974
‎yet he fell asleep before his turn came.

197
00:16:15,057 --> 00:16:16,266
‎I tell you,

198
00:16:16,892 --> 00:16:19,186
‎he will be the greatest man in our family.

199
00:16:19,937 --> 00:16:22,481
‎It has already been six days.

200
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:26,276
‎It is time your nephew returned home.

201
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:28,654
‎Let him stay for four more days.

202
00:16:28,737 --> 00:16:31,281
‎A full ten days,
‎then I shall have less regret.

203
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:33,993
‎Do you like him that much?

204
00:16:36,912 --> 00:16:39,248
‎Is it not remarkable?

205
00:16:39,331 --> 00:16:42,251
‎Only a few years ago,
‎he would toss these stones about in play.

206
00:16:42,793 --> 00:16:43,627
‎Now,

207
00:16:44,545 --> 00:16:46,547
‎he has become a most worthy opponent.

208
00:17:07,568 --> 00:17:08,444
‎There.

209
00:17:12,948 --> 00:17:13,824
‎Your arms.

210
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:21,665
‎You look absolutely lovely.

211
00:17:21,749 --> 00:17:24,334
‎When you get there, do nothing else.

212
00:17:24,418 --> 00:17:25,252
‎All right.

213
00:17:25,335 --> 00:17:27,504
‎Stand where the lord cannot miss you

214
00:17:27,588 --> 00:17:31,633
‎and simply say,
‎"I have brought a gift for the lady."

215
00:17:31,717 --> 00:17:32,593
‎And look at him

216
00:17:33,135 --> 00:17:34,344
‎like this.

217
00:17:35,512 --> 00:17:36,930
‎Like this.

218
00:17:37,014 --> 00:17:37,848
‎Try it.

219
00:17:39,266 --> 00:17:40,684
‎Like…

220
00:17:41,685 --> 00:17:43,270
‎Like this?

221
00:17:43,854 --> 00:17:47,066
‎Good! That's it!

222
00:19:04,476 --> 00:19:07,104
‎Well, who…

223
00:19:07,688 --> 00:19:08,605
‎Who are you?

224
00:19:09,606 --> 00:19:12,442
‎Well, my lord.

225
00:19:36,425 --> 00:19:38,677
‎My lady, she…

226
00:19:55,611 --> 00:19:57,696
‎My mother told me to deliver this.

227
00:19:58,488 --> 00:20:01,074
‎She said it must be given today,

228
00:20:01,158 --> 00:20:02,868
‎so I have come in person.

229
00:20:06,872 --> 00:20:08,290
‎Soaked to the bone.

230
00:20:09,708 --> 00:20:11,001
‎How unseemly.

231
00:20:14,755 --> 00:20:17,716
‎Your mother sent you out in the rain

232
00:20:18,675 --> 00:20:20,469
‎without even an overcoat?

233
00:20:23,305 --> 00:20:26,266
‎Warm yourself,
‎and return home when the sun is up.

234
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:28,310
‎And tell your mother

235
00:20:29,353 --> 00:20:31,271
‎that I commend her wit,

236
00:20:32,731 --> 00:20:34,233
‎but she has presumed too far.

237
00:20:35,234 --> 00:20:38,904
‎Gye-hwa, bring her dry clothes
‎and some hot water.

238
00:20:38,987 --> 00:20:39,863
‎Yes, madam.

239
00:20:52,918 --> 00:20:54,753
‎What a vulgar family.

240
00:20:55,254 --> 00:20:57,506
‎To send such a young girl out
‎for some trifling gift.

241
00:20:59,049 --> 00:21:01,426
‎If she gets through the day,
‎she should be fine.

242
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:03,637
‎It weighs on me
‎to see her laid up like this

243
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,347
‎when she has come as a guest.

244
00:21:06,139 --> 00:21:07,516
‎See to her medicine with care.

245
00:21:07,599 --> 00:21:09,017
‎Yes, my lord.

246
00:21:09,101 --> 00:21:10,602
‎Has she had anything to eat?

247
00:21:10,686 --> 00:21:14,398
‎Yes, the madam
‎had porridge prepared for her.

248
00:21:14,481 --> 00:21:16,441
‎Porridge alone
‎will not do for one so young.

249
00:21:19,403 --> 00:21:20,779
‎-Here, take this.
‎-Yes, sir.

250
00:21:23,699 --> 00:21:26,285
‎Thank you, my lord.

251
00:22:07,367 --> 00:22:09,911
‎That patch over there has sunk again.

252
00:22:11,413 --> 00:22:12,539
‎Give it some water.

253
00:22:31,183 --> 00:22:33,477
‎Madam, it is Gye-hwa.

254
00:22:33,560 --> 00:22:34,728
‎Pardon the intrusion.

255
00:22:41,610 --> 00:22:43,236
‎What is that now?

256
00:22:43,320 --> 00:22:46,615
‎It was sent by the Lady of the First Rank,
‎wife of the Left State Councilor.

257
00:22:47,574 --> 00:22:48,867
‎They said it's velvet antler.

258
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:59,336
‎It seems the Lady of the First Rank
‎has something to say to me.

259
00:23:01,129 --> 00:23:03,006
‎Find a fitting gift in return.

260
00:23:04,091 --> 00:23:05,759
‎If she calls for me, I must go.

261
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:24,069
‎Why has it been so long
‎since you last came?

262
00:23:24,152 --> 00:23:26,655
‎I was near beside myself with loneliness.

263
00:23:26,738 --> 00:23:30,242
‎Forgive me. I should have visited sooner.

264
00:23:31,076 --> 00:23:32,911
‎You have been well, I trust?

265
00:23:32,994 --> 00:23:33,995
‎I have.

266
00:23:34,955 --> 00:23:37,958
‎But you have not, I hear.

267
00:23:39,209 --> 00:23:40,752
‎My, my.

268
00:23:40,836 --> 00:23:44,214
‎How broad-minded you are, like a man.

269
00:23:48,301 --> 00:23:51,179
‎Why ever would you seek out
‎a concubine yourself?

270
00:23:55,142 --> 00:23:56,977
‎You know how thin Bukchon's walls are.

271
00:23:57,060 --> 00:23:59,271
‎Nothing stays hidden for long.

272
00:24:01,022 --> 00:24:02,065
‎So,

273
00:24:03,024 --> 00:24:04,860
‎when will you bring her in?

274
00:24:05,694 --> 00:24:07,320
‎I am still searching.

275
00:24:08,155 --> 00:24:10,157
‎I cannot bring just anyone in,

276
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:12,033
‎so there is much to consider.

277
00:24:19,166 --> 00:24:20,083
‎Not long ago,

278
00:24:21,209 --> 00:24:23,170
‎Lord Yoo presented my husband

279
00:24:23,253 --> 00:24:27,090
‎a great quantity of fine tobacco.

280
00:24:29,217 --> 00:24:32,387
‎I thought the Left State Councilor
‎has given up smoking.

281
00:24:36,391 --> 00:24:37,267
‎Do you

282
00:24:38,685 --> 00:24:40,937
‎truly know nothing of this?

283
00:24:43,273 --> 00:24:44,900
‎What do you mean?

284
00:24:44,983 --> 00:24:46,234
‎The concubine.

285
00:24:47,027 --> 00:24:48,904
‎Has it not already been decided?

286
00:24:50,739 --> 00:24:53,575
‎Where else would
‎such fine tobacco come from?

287
00:24:55,285 --> 00:24:57,537
‎From Haryanggyo, surely.

288
00:24:58,663 --> 00:25:00,165
‎It seems Lord Yoo

289
00:25:01,041 --> 00:25:05,128
‎has already visited dozens of times.

290
00:25:07,547 --> 00:25:09,382
‎Isn't that why you were planning

291
00:25:09,966 --> 00:25:12,677
‎to take in that Tobacco Shop girl
‎as his concubine?

292
00:25:17,057 --> 00:25:18,934
‎Make way!

293
00:25:21,478 --> 00:25:23,688
‎-What is all that, my lady?
‎-Make way!

294
00:25:24,689 --> 00:25:26,733
‎Oh, good heavens.

295
00:25:26,816 --> 00:25:28,485
‎Anyone would think

296
00:25:28,568 --> 00:25:32,322
‎those were betrothal gifts for a wedding.

297
00:25:36,409 --> 00:25:39,287
‎-It pays to be of noble blood.
‎-Indeed.

298
00:25:39,371 --> 00:25:41,248
‎Look at all the curious things
‎he received.

299
00:25:41,331 --> 00:25:43,333
‎Where did it all come from, the Qing?

300
00:25:43,917 --> 00:25:45,293
‎Watch it, the lady might hear you.

301
00:25:46,253 --> 00:25:47,462
‎Whoa, whoa.

302
00:25:54,678 --> 00:25:56,596
‎Put your back into it.

303
00:25:59,391 --> 00:26:00,850
‎All right, over here!

304
00:26:00,934 --> 00:26:01,768
‎What's the matter?

305
00:26:03,687 --> 00:26:05,188
‎Handle them carefully.

306
00:26:06,773 --> 00:26:07,732
‎Careful, it's valuable.

307
00:26:10,819 --> 00:26:11,987
‎Madam.

308
00:26:12,570 --> 00:26:14,030
‎Madam!

309
00:26:15,824 --> 00:26:18,618
‎I thought I made myself clear.
‎You were never to set foot here.

310
00:26:21,162 --> 00:26:22,414
‎So what is all this?

311
00:26:22,497 --> 00:26:23,790
‎Forgive me, madam.

312
00:26:24,332 --> 00:26:25,750
‎I did hear your words.

313
00:26:25,834 --> 00:26:29,045
‎But being an ignorant woman,
‎I knew no other way

314
00:26:29,546 --> 00:26:30,463
‎and came nonetheless.

315
00:26:30,547 --> 00:26:32,716
‎I have no grounds to accept these.

316
00:26:33,633 --> 00:26:35,176
‎Take them all back with you.

317
00:26:41,683 --> 00:26:42,600
‎Madam!

318
00:26:43,351 --> 00:26:45,687
‎-Gye-hwa, send her away at once.
‎-Yes, ma'am.

319
00:26:46,896 --> 00:26:47,731
‎-Please--
‎-Madam!

320
00:26:48,648 --> 00:26:52,152
‎I understand your anger, madam.

321
00:26:52,736 --> 00:26:54,904
‎How could I not?

322
00:26:54,988 --> 00:26:56,239
‎I am a woman too.

323
00:27:00,452 --> 00:27:01,411
‎What?

324
00:27:01,494 --> 00:27:03,913
‎Madam, I shall never forget

325
00:27:04,456 --> 00:27:08,084
‎your kindness in taking my daughter in,
‎not till the day I die.

326
00:27:09,169 --> 00:27:11,046
‎Had you not taken her under your wing,

327
00:27:11,129 --> 00:27:14,007
‎His Lordship would not have come to take

328
00:27:14,591 --> 00:27:16,134
‎my So-ok as his concubine.

329
00:27:22,724 --> 00:27:25,602
‎If it please you, set the date yourself.

330
00:27:26,186 --> 00:27:30,231
‎Until then, I will see that
‎my girl is properly taught.

331
00:27:31,649 --> 00:27:33,443
‎I am most grateful, madam.

332
00:27:53,713 --> 00:27:56,591
‎All right, then. Like this.

333
00:27:58,343 --> 00:27:59,427
‎Let me try now.

334
00:27:59,511 --> 00:28:02,847
‎-Like this.
‎-Oh, don't move, my lord!

335
00:28:02,931 --> 00:28:05,642
‎All right, all right. Try it like this.

336
00:28:13,066 --> 00:28:15,026
‎-Please do it again.
‎-Very well.

337
00:28:15,860 --> 00:28:19,614
‎Try to do it properly this time. Here.

338
00:28:26,204 --> 00:28:28,289
‎Let me see…

339
00:28:43,388 --> 00:28:46,224
‎The lady of the Tobacco Shop came by.

340
00:28:49,102 --> 00:28:51,646
‎It seems she came unannounced,
‎rather impertinently.

341
00:28:52,689 --> 00:28:54,274
‎You must have been quite surprised.

342
00:28:55,358 --> 00:28:56,317
‎Did you

343
00:28:57,694 --> 00:28:59,738
‎find that girl to your liking?

344
00:29:06,494 --> 00:29:07,328
‎My lady.

345
00:29:08,705 --> 00:29:11,082
‎I told you I had no wish for it,

346
00:29:11,166 --> 00:29:13,001
‎but you would not relent.

347
00:29:13,084 --> 00:29:16,171
‎I only felt sorry
‎to leave the burden to you alone.

348
00:29:16,713 --> 00:29:18,965
‎A concubine is no great matter,

349
00:29:19,048 --> 00:29:21,050
‎so I thought
‎someone like her would suffice.

350
00:29:49,162 --> 00:29:53,166
‎Madam, a gift has arrived
‎from the Chief Royal Secretary's house.

351
00:29:54,125 --> 00:29:59,047
‎Well, the other ladies
‎have also sent small gift boxes.

352
00:29:59,130 --> 00:30:00,465
‎Shall I bring them in as well?

353
00:30:08,181 --> 00:30:09,390
‎Whoa, whoa.

354
00:30:10,391 --> 00:30:12,227
‎All right, down now.

355
00:30:21,611 --> 00:30:24,781
‎My cousin's aunt is close
‎to that woman from the Tobacco Shop,

356
00:30:25,865 --> 00:30:28,827
‎and this is what she told me.

357
00:30:29,244 --> 00:30:30,328
‎The second daughter,

358
00:30:31,162 --> 00:30:34,249
‎who had just come of age,
‎went to the Minister's house late at night

359
00:30:34,332 --> 00:30:35,875
‎and set her sights on him.

360
00:30:35,959 --> 00:30:37,877
‎-How indecent!
‎-Good heavens.

361
00:30:37,961 --> 00:30:40,755
‎Some even say
‎they've already heard a baby cry.

362
00:30:40,839 --> 00:30:42,048
‎The Minister's baby.

363
00:30:42,131 --> 00:30:44,592
‎Before me? Surely not.

364
00:30:48,054 --> 00:30:49,347
‎No, what I heard is

365
00:30:49,430 --> 00:30:53,601
‎he has been having
‎an improper relationship with the mother.

366
00:30:53,685 --> 00:30:55,478
‎Oh, my. Is that true?

367
00:30:55,562 --> 00:30:56,729
‎Surely not.

368
00:30:57,647 --> 00:30:59,941
‎The Minister of Rites would never,
‎with a woman like that.

369
00:31:00,024 --> 00:31:03,695
‎Be that as it may,
‎there is already a baby, is there not?

370
00:31:03,778 --> 00:31:05,572
‎But with so many eyes upon them,

371
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:09,450
‎his lady feigns generosity, as though
‎seeking him a concubine of her own accord.

372
00:31:10,285 --> 00:31:13,663
‎After acting so lofty, like a crane.

373
00:31:13,746 --> 00:31:16,791
‎By the by, it has been some time
‎since we sent gifts,

374
00:31:16,875 --> 00:31:18,334
‎and still not a word--

375
00:31:19,878 --> 00:31:20,795
‎Madam.

376
00:31:21,671 --> 00:31:25,758
‎Your laughter carried
‎all the way to the inner quarters.

377
00:31:26,467 --> 00:31:29,262
‎You seemed much amused by your tale.

378
00:31:29,345 --> 00:31:31,306
‎Please share it with me.

379
00:31:31,389 --> 00:31:32,807
‎I am most curious.

380
00:31:33,474 --> 00:31:36,102
‎We had heard nothing
‎and wondered when you might arrive.

381
00:31:38,021 --> 00:31:39,689
‎The fragrance is most pleasing.

382
00:31:39,772 --> 00:31:42,108
‎And the weather is quite lovely.

383
00:31:52,827 --> 00:31:53,953
‎Don't I look pretty?

384
00:31:54,746 --> 00:31:56,623
‎Aren't I doing well? Look.

385
00:31:57,749 --> 00:31:59,542
‎One, two.

386
00:32:04,213 --> 00:32:05,131
‎Mal-ttong!

387
00:32:18,436 --> 00:32:19,771
‎No, come here!

388
00:32:45,046 --> 00:32:47,966
‎I saw that spring
‎had come in full this morning,

389
00:32:48,049 --> 00:32:50,093
‎and wished to bring this to you.

390
00:32:52,345 --> 00:32:54,222
‎Did you sleep well through the night?

391
00:32:55,473 --> 00:32:56,432
‎My lady.

392
00:33:16,369 --> 00:33:17,370
‎Cho-hui.

393
00:33:23,001 --> 00:33:24,252
‎Is that a flower?

394
00:33:25,545 --> 00:33:26,504
‎How lovely.

395
00:33:32,510 --> 00:33:35,805
‎Did you find its petals so fair?

396
00:33:39,434 --> 00:33:41,686
‎I have before me a spring far lovelier,

397
00:33:42,520 --> 00:33:44,230
‎so I hardly noticed.

398
00:33:45,690 --> 00:33:49,068
‎How do you speak so beautifully?

399
00:33:51,070 --> 00:33:53,865
‎Such clear tears, already welling.

400
00:33:56,743 --> 00:33:59,620
‎Then again, you are at an age
‎when the heart runs wild.

401
00:34:06,461 --> 00:34:09,172
‎Very well. Off with you now.

402
00:34:10,673 --> 00:34:11,507
‎Yes.

403
00:34:14,010 --> 00:34:16,012
‎Thank you, my lady.

404
00:34:35,573 --> 00:34:36,491
‎"Mun-heul."

405
00:34:37,450 --> 00:34:39,285
‎That is the pen name I have given myself.

406
00:34:40,578 --> 00:34:43,206
‎Like the moon
‎rising highest in the night sky,

407
00:34:43,790 --> 00:34:46,125
‎I only hope that my writings,

408
00:34:46,751 --> 00:34:48,377
‎which may never see the light of day,

409
00:34:48,461 --> 00:34:50,797
‎might at least rise high in the darkness.

410
00:34:52,215 --> 00:34:55,885
‎And so, this moment of exchanging letters
‎with you brings me comfort.

411
00:34:56,928 --> 00:34:59,055
‎From now on,
‎I shall write to you under this name.

412
00:35:00,181 --> 00:35:01,265
‎On that note,

413
00:35:02,183 --> 00:35:05,686
‎if you are so inclined,
‎would you take the name Cho-hui?

414
00:35:06,896 --> 00:35:08,773
‎It was Nanseolheon's given name.

415
00:35:10,525 --> 00:35:12,360
‎On my way back from the village school,

416
00:35:12,443 --> 00:35:13,653
‎a flower fell

417
00:35:14,403 --> 00:35:16,155
‎and came to rest upon my hand.

418
00:35:17,406 --> 00:35:21,202
‎It felt as though
‎it had been destined for me,

419
00:35:21,702 --> 00:35:24,080
‎so I held it fast and brought it home.

420
00:35:25,998 --> 00:35:28,209
‎I entrust my fate to you.

421
00:35:28,793 --> 00:35:29,794
‎Please do not lose it.

422
00:36:13,171 --> 00:36:14,297
‎My lord!

423
00:36:14,964 --> 00:36:16,465
‎Lord Cho Won!

424
00:36:17,717 --> 00:36:18,718
‎A letter has come!

425
00:36:24,015 --> 00:36:25,391
‎I'll leave it here.

426
00:36:25,474 --> 00:36:26,434
‎How is it?

427
00:36:34,817 --> 00:36:39,530
‎They say the Chief State Councilor's wife
‎has a pipe near nine ‎cheok‎ long.

428
00:36:39,614 --> 00:36:43,117
‎The steward says the pipe is so long

429
00:36:43,201 --> 00:36:46,162
‎the maid must cross
‎to the next room just to light it.

430
00:36:47,914 --> 00:36:49,999
‎"Have you put it in yet?"

431
00:36:50,082 --> 00:36:52,960
‎"Yes, my lady! Keep sucking!"

432
00:36:53,044 --> 00:36:55,129
‎-"How nice!"
‎-My lord!

433
00:36:55,671 --> 00:36:59,759
‎MUN-HEUL

434
00:37:03,596 --> 00:37:04,430
‎How nice.

435
00:37:05,097 --> 00:37:06,307
‎My lord.

436
00:37:06,390 --> 00:37:08,517
‎Mine has a sour taste.

437
00:37:08,601 --> 00:37:10,937
‎A sharp tang that hits the throat.

438
00:37:11,520 --> 00:37:12,355
‎The throat?

439
00:37:14,607 --> 00:37:16,192
‎No, that won't do.

440
00:37:16,817 --> 00:37:18,361
‎Is it that tang

441
00:37:19,654 --> 00:37:22,531
‎that pleases you or…

442
00:37:23,532 --> 00:37:26,118
‎-Is it like a maiden's first night?
‎-Or…

443
00:37:29,330 --> 00:37:30,539
‎Where is it from?

444
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:33,542
‎It has been some time,
‎I should like to feel it again.

445
00:37:33,626 --> 00:37:36,504
‎It's Samdeungcho.

446
00:37:36,587 --> 00:37:39,423
‎I thought the men from that region
‎tasted rather sour.

447
00:37:39,507 --> 00:37:40,424
‎Enough.

448
00:37:42,969 --> 00:37:44,512
‎-All of you, out.
‎-Pardon?

449
00:37:55,064 --> 00:37:56,482
‎Cho-hui!

450
00:38:10,746 --> 00:38:12,957
‎MUN-HEUL

451
00:38:25,052 --> 00:38:26,679
‎What brings this on?

452
00:38:26,762 --> 00:38:28,931
‎You never eat such things, young master.

453
00:38:33,477 --> 00:38:36,105
‎To my cousin, Cho Won.

454
00:38:38,733 --> 00:38:42,445
‎Spring has already begun
‎to stir in Bukchon,

455
00:38:43,070 --> 00:38:44,947
‎and my heart follows it.

456
00:38:45,573 --> 00:38:48,451
‎I find myself missing you all the more.

457
00:38:51,078 --> 00:38:53,039
‎Have you been well?

458
00:39:10,306 --> 00:39:12,266
‎I must see you.

459
00:39:12,892 --> 00:39:16,187
‎Please come to see me at once.

460
00:39:17,688 --> 00:39:20,399
‎I can no longer bear

461
00:39:20,900 --> 00:39:23,402
‎to leave this longing as it is.

462
00:39:30,451 --> 00:39:34,080
‎Madam, Lord Cho Won is
‎on his way to Hanyang.

463
00:40:22,837 --> 00:40:25,381
‎It seems all of Joseon has gathered here.

464
00:40:27,466 --> 00:40:29,343
‎Good heavens, he will kill him!

465
00:40:30,970 --> 00:40:33,556
‎-Down he goes!
‎-Damn it!

466
00:40:33,639 --> 00:40:36,350
‎Won your bet?
‎Must be in high spirits! Half price!

467
00:40:36,434 --> 00:40:39,478
‎Lost your bet?
‎Sweeten your mood! Half price!

468
00:40:39,562 --> 00:40:42,731
‎Sweet, sticky taffy!

469
00:40:42,815 --> 00:40:45,276
‎Here, buy some taffy!

470
00:40:45,359 --> 00:40:48,737
‎-Get your taffy here!
‎-Buy some taffy!

471
00:40:48,821 --> 00:40:51,866
‎-Get your taffy!
‎-Why such haste, ladies?

472
00:40:51,949 --> 00:40:53,659
‎Come, share a drink with us.

473
00:40:53,742 --> 00:40:54,994
‎Come by later.

474
00:40:55,995 --> 00:40:57,663
‎Which fellow is that?

475
00:40:57,746 --> 00:40:59,790
‎So? Which one?

476
00:41:00,583 --> 00:41:03,794
‎This one and that
‎All sorts of lads gather here

477
00:41:03,878 --> 00:41:07,173
‎Then scatter again

478
00:41:07,256 --> 00:41:09,800
‎-‎This here is
‎-Hey! Clear off, you brats!

479
00:41:09,884 --> 00:41:13,220
‎-‎Hanyang, the capital
‎-What are you doing back here? Go away!

480
00:41:13,304 --> 00:41:15,097
‎Cross Gwangtonggyo over Cheonggyecheon

481
00:41:15,181 --> 00:41:16,807
‎To the south

482
00:41:16,891 --> 00:41:19,143
‎And you come to Namchon
‎Where the lowly dwell

483
00:41:19,226 --> 00:41:20,102
‎Hear, hear!

484
00:41:20,186 --> 00:41:21,353
‎Cross to the north

485
00:41:21,437 --> 00:41:23,814
‎And you come to Bukchon
‎Where the high-born reside

486
00:41:23,898 --> 00:41:27,151
‎Bukchon, what a sight it is

487
00:41:27,234 --> 00:41:30,029
‎Clear the way!

488
00:41:31,155 --> 00:41:34,450
‎Make way!

489
00:41:35,284 --> 00:41:37,453
‎Clear the way at once!

490
00:41:38,704 --> 00:41:40,831
‎Clear the way at once!

491
00:41:40,915 --> 00:41:46,462
‎Palanquins bearing high officials
‎As the bearers' calls ring out

492
00:41:46,545 --> 00:41:49,340
‎Animals scurry to hide

493
00:41:49,423 --> 00:41:53,135
‎Birds fold their wings

494
00:41:53,219 --> 00:41:56,055
‎Surely this is the finest place

495
00:41:56,138 --> 00:41:59,975
‎In all of Hanyang

496
00:42:00,059 --> 00:42:01,560
‎Is it not?

497
00:42:02,102 --> 00:42:04,980
‎Be that as it may

498
00:42:05,940 --> 00:42:07,858
‎This is Bukchon

499
00:42:25,084 --> 00:42:27,211
‎I will escort you
‎to the inner quarters, my lord.

500
00:42:55,489 --> 00:42:56,448
‎Madam.

501
00:42:56,991 --> 00:42:58,784
‎Lord Cho Won is here.

502
00:43:06,750 --> 00:43:08,085
‎Send him in.

503
00:43:32,693 --> 00:43:34,111
‎The journey to Hanyang

504
00:43:34,778 --> 00:43:36,405
‎seems to have taken you some time.

505
00:43:37,489 --> 00:43:40,159
‎I had long stayed away,
‎thinking I ought not to come here.

506
00:43:41,327 --> 00:43:43,120
‎Thus, I was unfamiliar with the road.

507
00:43:44,788 --> 00:43:46,332
‎Have I kept you waiting long?

508
00:43:53,130 --> 00:43:54,673
‎Have you been well?

509
00:43:56,967 --> 00:43:58,636
‎With the moon rising and setting each day

510
00:44:00,220 --> 00:44:03,182
‎and the flowers blooming in full
‎each passing season,

511
00:44:04,224 --> 00:44:05,392
‎I have been

512
00:44:06,852 --> 00:44:08,145
‎quite well indeed.

513
00:44:08,812 --> 00:44:09,938
‎You are as fair

514
00:44:11,899 --> 00:44:12,733
‎as ever.

515
00:44:17,738 --> 00:44:19,031
‎In truth,

516
00:44:19,823 --> 00:44:23,202
‎I have a favor to ask of you.

517
00:44:24,161 --> 00:44:25,079
‎A favor?

518
00:44:32,169 --> 00:44:33,796
‎What could it be,

519
00:44:33,879 --> 00:44:37,049
‎that you would break
‎such long silence to write to me?

520
00:44:38,425 --> 00:44:40,427
‎We have decided to bring in a concubine.

521
00:44:43,347 --> 00:44:46,225
‎And so I ask this of you.

522
00:44:49,895 --> 00:44:51,480
‎So-ok, who is to be the concubine.

523
00:44:52,564 --> 00:44:55,526
‎Please see that
‎tender, young bud bears a child.

524
00:44:58,278 --> 00:44:59,113
‎Pardon?

525
00:45:01,907 --> 00:45:02,950
‎And if I refuse…

526
00:45:05,911 --> 00:45:07,955
‎will this be the last day I see you?

527
00:45:08,997 --> 00:45:11,375
‎I am always by your side.

528
00:45:12,459 --> 00:45:15,003
‎Was it not you who deemed this

529
00:45:15,087 --> 00:45:16,880
‎a place you must not come?

530
00:45:17,464 --> 00:45:19,716
‎-Me?
‎-I hear you have spent your years

531
00:45:19,800 --> 00:45:22,302
‎plucking every pretty flower
‎beyond Hanyang.

532
00:45:23,679 --> 00:45:26,056
‎Then show me, this once,
‎how much you have changed.

533
00:45:26,140 --> 00:45:28,934
‎The extent of your skill.

534
00:45:29,017 --> 00:45:32,104
‎To display my skill on a naive girl

535
00:45:33,856 --> 00:45:35,941
‎who would fall at the lightest touch…

536
00:45:37,651 --> 00:45:39,820
‎She'd break at a mere breeze at that age.

537
00:45:39,903 --> 00:45:43,615
‎That is why I ask you
‎to see that she bears a child.

538
00:45:53,750 --> 00:45:56,211
‎The lack of a child
‎between you and your husband…

539
00:45:59,381 --> 00:46:00,507
‎Is it his fault then?

540
00:46:04,136 --> 00:46:05,512
‎Certainly not.

541
00:46:06,972 --> 00:46:09,475
‎What fault could there be in him?

542
00:46:09,558 --> 00:46:11,894
‎The fault is mine. My own lack of virtue.

543
00:46:13,687 --> 00:46:15,189
‎This is how I was taught

544
00:46:16,523 --> 00:46:18,901
‎a woman must behave.

545
00:46:18,984 --> 00:46:21,945
‎Keep silent, bow her head,
‎and serve her husband.

546
00:46:24,198 --> 00:46:25,240
‎Is that so?

547
00:46:26,575 --> 00:46:27,409
‎But

548
00:46:27,993 --> 00:46:30,162
‎why must it be my child?

549
00:46:33,540 --> 00:46:35,250
‎Because I wish to hold…

550
00:46:37,961 --> 00:46:40,547
‎a child that bears your likeness
‎in my arms.

551
00:46:43,425 --> 00:46:46,053
‎The secret joy
‎of being with such a child shall be

552
00:46:47,846 --> 00:46:49,473
‎the solace of my remaining years.

553
00:46:57,814 --> 00:46:59,233
‎Do you still…

554
00:47:02,236 --> 00:47:03,320
‎hold me…

555
00:47:05,364 --> 00:47:07,115
‎in your heart?

556
00:47:13,914 --> 00:47:14,748
‎Do you?

557
00:47:17,668 --> 00:47:18,710
‎Is that it?

558
00:51:05,103 --> 00:51:10,108
‎Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song
